Daśaratha orders army wealth merchants to follow Rāma --- Daśaratha bids luxuries follow Rāma into forest --- Kaikēyī fears Bharata will reject emptied kingdom --- Daśaratha rebukes Kaikēyī for goading him --- Kaikēyī cites Sagara exiling Asamañja precedent --- Siddhārtha tells Asamañja cruelty to children --- Siddhārtha says Sagara exiled son for subjects --- Daśaratha vows to follow Rāma leaving kingdom
